---
import { philosophy } from '../content/site';
---

<section id="philosophy" class="section">
  <div class="page-shell"><div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">DESIGN PHILOSOPHY</p><h2>所需一切，就在一处</h2><p class="section-description">BeCoder 先准备好环境，整套目录可以移动；同时为产品、用户项目和用户自己的系统终端划清边界。</p></div>
    <div class="philosophy-grid">{philosophy.map((item) => <article><p>{item.number}</p><h3>{item.title}</h3><span>{item.englishTitle}</span><p>{item.description}</p></article>)}</div>
  </div>
</section>
